<body data-time="present">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Tri<b>plicity</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#pricing">The Years</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply</a></nav>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present on">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Coaching with <em>a real coach.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Triplicity is the coaching company. A private session every week, a small group of six, and a daily lesson, for one year. Being mindful is the work.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply for the Coached Year</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome">Welcome to Triplicity · The present · <b>Love</b> the life you are in</p>
      </div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two colleagues high-fiving at a desk" width="1400" height="933" fetchpriority="high" /></div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>1</b><span>Private session a week</span></div><div><b>6</b><span>People in your group</span></div><div><b>12</b><span>Months</span></div><div><b>18</b><span>Clients, max, per year</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>You know what to do.<br>You need someone in the room when you don't.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Alone</h3><p>Good intentions with no one checking in.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unread</h3><p>You write it down. Nobody reads it.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Faded</h3><p>The weekend high. Gone by Tuesday.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec"><div class="wrap gallery"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573497620053-ea5300f94f21?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two women in conversation at a table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The session</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577962917302-cd874c4e31d2?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A diverse team laughing together" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The group</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600486913747-55e5470d6f40?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A man smiling outdoors" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>The year</figcaption></figure></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years leading teams and families through hard seasons. He does the same daily lesson you do, on the same calendar.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Apply</h3><p>A 30-minute call with Russ within two days. You decide together if it fits.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Two weeks</h3><p>Write three lines a night. He reads them before your first session.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The year</h3><p>A private session every week. Your group of six every week. One lesson a day.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>A year, not a weekend.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Coached Year</h3><div class="price">$1,250<small>/mo</small></div><p>A private session a week, a group of six, a lesson a day. Twelve months.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For families</div><h3>The Family Year</h3><div class="price">$2,500<small>/mo</small></div><p>For two to four people in one household. One coach. One rhythm.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For leaders</div><h3>Executive &amp; Team</h3><div class="price">$6,000<small>/mo</small></div><p>One leader, plus a group of up to eight from the team.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" data-open-form>Ask</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Not ready for a coach? <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Start with the daily lesson at Vault Human, $97 a month.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">Triplicity is the coaching company inside Vault Human. Every coaching program lives here. It is not a law firm and not a systems shop.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Fixes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green me" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com"><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. Runs every Vault Human coaching program.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Triplicity do?</summary><p>Coaching, for a year, with a real coach who reads what you write.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. If you need a therapist, we say so.</p></details><details><summary>Who coaches?</summary><p>Russ. Eighteen clients a year, in three groups of six.</p></details><details><summary>How much time?</summary><p>Ten minutes a day, fifty minutes a week with your coach, an hour a week with your group.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Apply for the Coached Year.</h2><p class="lede">A 30-minute call with Russ. Then you decide.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Apply for the Coached Year</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap foot">
      <div><a class="brand" href="/">Tri<b>plicity</b></a><p>Coaching with a real coach.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
      <ul><li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li><li><a href="#pricing">The Years</a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li></ul>
